                                "sense_id": "af0f5ca5-94b8-3734-8513-519b045f7a5d",
                                "text": "The first species of the Sternopygidae mentioned in literature is the carapo of Marcgrav. The name Gymnotus was apparently introduced by Artedi [...]"
